{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.34, "text": "En wat gaan we je nu laten zien is hoe je dus dit krijgt en hoe je dit voorkomt.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.68}, {"w": "wat", "s": 0.68, "e": 0.96}, {"w": "gaan", "s": 0.96, "e": 1.18}, {"w": "we", "s": 1.18, "e": 1.26}, {"w": "je", "s": 1.26, "e": 1.4}, {"w": "nu", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.62}, {"w": "laten", "s": 1.62, "e": 1.94}, {"w": "zien", "s": 1.94, "e": 2.22}, {"w": "is", "s": 2.22, "e": 2.52}, {"w": "hoe", "s": 2.52, "e": 2.74}, {"w": "je", "s": 2.74, "e": 2.92}, {"w": "dus", "s": 2.92, "e": 3.3}, {"w": "dit", "s": 3.3, "e": 3.48}, {"w": "krijgt", "s": 3.48, "e": 4.18}, {"w": "en", "s": 4.18, "e": 4.44}, {"w": "hoe", "s": 4.44, "e": 4.7}, {"w": "je", "s": 4.7, "e": 5.0}, {"w": "dit", "s": 5.0, "e": 5.34}, {"w": "voorkomt.", "s": 5.34, "e": 6.34}]}, {"start": 6.7, "end": 12.26, "text": "En aan het einde geven we daar ook nog even een tip over voor eventuele kruisijnen en hoekstukjes.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 6.7, "e": 6.86}, {"w": "aan", "s": 6.86, "e": 6.96}, {"w": "het", "s": 6.96, "e": 7.2}, {"w": "einde", "s": 7.2, "e": 7.46}, {"w": "geven", "s": 7.46, "e": 7.7}, {"w": "we", "s": 7.7, "e": 7.84}, {"w": "daar", "s": 7.84, "e": 7.98}, {"w": "ook", "s": 7.98, "e": 8.1}, {"w": "nog", "s": 8.1, "e": 8.24}, {"w": "even", "s": 8.24, "e": 8.48}, {"w": "een", "s": 8.48, "e": 8.62}, {"w": "tip", "s": 8.62, "e": 8.84}, {"w": "over", "s": 8.84, "e": 9.3}, {"w": "voor", "s": 9.3, "e": 9.86}, {"w": "eventuele", "s": 9.86, "e": 10.66}, {"w": "kruisijnen", "s": 10.66, "e": 11.44}, {"w": "en", "s": 11.44, "e": 11.66}, {"w": "hoekstukjes.", "s": 11.66, "e": 12.26}]}, {"start": 12.32, "end": 14.98, "text": "Want daar ontstaan natuurlijk dat je het op elkaar moet gaan afstellen.", "words": [{"w": "Want", "s": 12.32, "e": 12.46}, {"w": "daar", "s": 12.46, "e": 12.72}, {"w": "ontstaan", "s": 12.72, "e": 13.1}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 13.1, "e": 13.42}, {"w": "dat", "s": 13.42, "e": 13.56}, {"w": "je", "s": 13.56, "e": 13.7}, {"w": "het", "s": 13.7, "e": 13.84}, {"w": "op", "s": 13.84, "e": 13.98}, {"w": "elkaar", "s": 13.98, "e": 14.14}, {"w": "moet", "s": 14.14, "e": 14.32}, {"w": "gaan", "s": 14.32, "e": 14.54}, {"w": "afstellen.", "s": 14.54, "e": 14.98}]}, {"start": 29.0, "end": 30.9, "text": "En er zijn nog wel wat keuzes in de markt.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 29.0, "e": 29.44}, {"w": "er", "s": 29.44, "e": 29.58}, {"w": "zijn", "s": 29.58, "e": 29.7}, {"w": "nog", "s": 29.7, "e": 29.88}, {"w": "wel", "s": 29.88, "e": 30.0}, {"w": "wat", "s": 30.0, "e": 30.16}, {"w": "keuzes", "s": 30.16, "e": 30.48}, {"w": "in", "s": 30.48, "e": 30.62}, {"w": "de", "s": 30.62, "e": 30.74}, {"w": "markt.", "s": 30.74, "e": 30.9}]}, {"start": 31.0, "end": 37.84, "text": "We hebben namelijk de harde perenplaten en aan de andere kant heb je eigenlijk de wolsoorten.", "words": [{"w": "We", "s": 31.0, "e": 31.0}, {"w": "hebben", "s": 31.0, "e": 31.2}, {"w": "namelijk", "s": 31.2, "e": 31.6}, {"w": "de", "s": 31.6, "e": 32.78}, {"w": "harde", "s": 32.78, "e": 33.14}, {"w": "perenplaten", "s": 33.14, "e": 33.8}, {"w": "en", "s": 33.8, "e": 34.52}, {"w": "aan", "s": 34.52, "e": 34.92}, {"w": "de", "s": 34.92, "e": 34.92}, {"w": "andere", "s": 34.92, "e": 35.12}, {"w": "kant", "s": 35.12, "e": 35.36}, {"w": "heb", "s": 35.36, "e": 35.48}, {"w": "je", "s": 35.48, "e": 35.6}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 35.6, "e": 36.08}, {"w": "de", "s": 36.08, "e": 36.54}, {"w": "wolsoorten.", "s": 36.54, "e": 37.84}]}, {"start": 38.06, "end": 42.72, "text": "En de wolsoorten bestaan in dit geval, voor iedereen dat goed kan zien, uit de steenwollen.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 38.06, "e": 38.22}, {"w": "de", "s": 38.22, "e": 38.28}, {"w": "wolsoorten", "s": 38.28, "e": 38.78}, {"w": "bestaan", "s": 38.78, "e": 39.08}, {"w": "in", "s": 39.08, "e": 39.32}, {"w": "dit", "s": 39.32, "e": 39.46}, {"w": "geval,", "s": 39.46, "e": 39.92}, {"w": "voor", "s": 39.96, "e": 40.08}, {"w": "iedereen", "s": 40.08, "e": 40.38}, {"w": "dat", "s": 40.38, "e": 40.48}, {"w": "goed", "s": 40.48, "e": 40.66}, {"w": "kan", "s": 40.66, "e": 40.84}, {"w": "zien,", "s": 40.84, "e": 41.02}, {"w": "uit", "s": 41.06, "e": 41.58}, {"w": "de", "s": 41.58, "e": 42.2}, {"w": "steenwollen.", "s": 42.2, "e": 42.72}]}, {"start": 42.72, "end": 47.3, "text": "De isolatiewollen en de bio-based-wollen noemen ze het ook wel.", "words": [{"w": "De", "s": 42.72, "e": 43.44}, {"w": "isolatiewollen", "s": 43.44, "e": 44.34}, {"w": "en", "s": 44.34, "e": 45.04}, {"w": "de", "s": 45.04, "e": 45.32}, {"w": "bio", "s": 45.32, "e": 45.68}, {"w": "-based", "s": 45.68, "e": 46.04}, {"w": "-wollen", "s": 46.04, "e": 46.32}, {"w": "noemen", "s": 46.32, "e": 46.54}, {"w": "ze", "s": 46.54, "e": 46.66}, {"w": "het", "s": 46.66, "e": 46.78}, {"w": "ook", "s": 46.78, "e": 46.98}, {"w": "wel.", "s": 46.98, "e": 47.3}]}, {"start": 48.0, "end": 49.06, "text": "En natuurlijk de glaswol.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 48.0, "e": 48.18}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 48.18, "e": 48.38}, {"w": "de", "s": 48.38, "e": 48.6}, {"w": "glaswol.", "s": 48.6, "e": 49.06}]}, {"start": 49.76, "end": 52.2, "text": "En dat zijn eigenlijk de wollen die veel gebruikt worden.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 49.76, "e": 50.2}, {"w": "dat", "s": 50.2, "e": 50.3}, {"w": "zijn", "s": 50.3, "e": 50.42}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 50.42, "e": 50.64}, {"w": "de", "s": 50.64, "e": 50.84}, {"w": "wollen", "s": 50.84, "e": 50.96}, {"w": "die", "s": 50.96, "e": 51.18}, {"w": "veel", "s": 51.18, "e": 51.46}, {"w": "gebruikt", "s": 51.46, "e": 51.94}, {"w": "worden.", "s": 51.94, "e": 52.2}]}, {"start": 52.56, "end": 55.86, "text": "Het materialen heeft een iets hogere isolatiewaarde.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 52.56, "e": 52.64}, {"w": "materialen", "s": 52.64, "e": 53.58}, {"w": "heeft", "s": 53.58, "e": 53.72}, {"w": "een", "s": 53.72, "e": 53.86}, {"w": "iets", "s": 53.86, "e": 54.18}, {"w": "hogere", "s": 54.18, "e": 54.54}, {"w": "isolatiewaarde.", "s": 54.54, "e": 55.86}]}, {"start": 55.92, "end": 60.98, "text": "Dat betekent dat je gewoon wat minder groot vlak eigenlijk juist de isolatie kan plaatsen.", "words": [{"w": "Dat", "s": 55.92, "e": 56.1}, {"w": "betekent", "s": 56.1, "e": 56.26}, {"w": "dat", "s": 56.26, "e": 56.36}, {"w": "je", "s": 56.36, "e": 56.5}, {"w": "gewoon", "s": 56.5, "e": 56.74}, {"w": "wat", "s": 56.74, "e": 57.06}, {"w": "minder", "s": 57.06, "e": 57.36}, {"w": "groot", "s": 57.36, "e": 57.64}, {"w": "vlak", "s": 57.64, "e": 58.6}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 58.6, "e": 59.34}, {"w": "juist", "s": 59.34, "e": 59.58}, {"w": "de", "s": 59.58, "e": 59.76}, {"w": "isolatie", "s": 59.76, "e": 60.14}, {"w": "kan", "s": 60.14, "e": 60.42}, {"w": "plaatsen.", "s": 60.42, "e": 60.98}]}, {"start": 62.06, "end": 66.36, "text": "En deze materialen worden gebruikt op het moment dat je wat meer ruimte hebt.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 62.06, "e": 62.44}, {"w": "deze", "s": 62.44, "e": 62.7}, {"w": "materialen", "s": 62.7, "e": 63.36}, {"w": "worden", "s": 63.36, "e": 63.56}, {"w": "gebruikt", "s": 63.56, "e": 64.42}, {"w": "op", "s": 64.42, "e": 64.68}, {"w": "het", "s": 64.68, "e": 64.72}, {"w": "moment", "s": 64.72, "e": 64.98}, {"w": "dat", "s": 64.98, "e": 65.12}, {"w": "je", "s": 65.12, "e": 65.22}, {"w": "wat", "s": 65.22, "e": 65.44}, {"w": "meer", "s": 65.44, "e": 65.82}, {"w": "ruimte", "s": 65.82, "e": 66.16}, {"w": "hebt.", "s": 66.16, "e": 66.36}]}, {"start": 66.66, "end": 69.54, "text": "Het is wat makkelijker te verwerken over het algemeen.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 66.66, "e": 66.84}, {"w": "is", "s": 66.84, "e": 67.04}, {"w": "wat", "s": 67.04, "e": 67.26}, {"w": "makkelijker", "s": 67.26, "e": 67.82}, {"w": "te", "s": 67.82, "e": 68.04}, {"w": "verwerken", "s": 68.04, "e": 68.44}, {"w": "over", "s": 68.44, "e": 68.68}, {"w": "het", "s": 68.68, "e": 68.96}, {"w": "algemeen.", "s": 68.96, "e": 69.54}]}, {"start": 69.54, "end": 75.14, "text": "Als dit allemaal ongelijk is, dan gaat die plaat natuurlijk ook een klein beetje ongelijk liggen.", "words": [{"w": "Als", "s": 69.54, "e": 70.14}, {"w": "dit", "s": 70.14, "e": 71.62}, {"w": "allemaal", "s": 71.62, "e": 72.02}, {"w": "ongelijk", "s": 72.02, "e": 72.66}, {"w": "is,", "s": 72.66, "e": 72.78}, {"w": "dan", "s": 72.88, "e": 72.92}, {"w": "gaat", "s": 72.92, "e": 73.04}, {"w": "die", "s": 73.04, "e": 73.22}, {"w": "plaat", "s": 73.22, "e": 73.5}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 73.5, "e": 73.78}, {"w": "ook", "s": 73.78, "e": 73.96}, {"w": "een", "s": 73.96, "e": 74.04}, {"w": "klein", "s": 74.04, "e": 74.16}, {"w": "beetje", "s": 74.16, "e": 74.38}, {"w": "ongelijk", "s": 74.38, "e": 74.96}, {"w": "liggen.", "s": 74.96, "e": 75.14}]}, {"start": 75.6, "end": 80.08, "text": "En dat is natuurlijk het voordeel van wol, dat het eigenlijk op alle plekken goed aansluit.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 75.6, "e": 75.66}, {"w": "dat", "s": 75.66, "e": 75.74}, {"w": "is", "s": 75.74, "e": 75.88}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 75.88, "e": 76.08}, {"w": "het", "s": 76.08, "e": 76.26}, {"w": "voordeel", "s": 76.26, "e": 76.6}, {"w": "van", "s": 76.6, "e": 76.9}, {"w": "wol,", "s": 76.9, "e": 77.1}, {"w": "dat", "s": 77.14, "e": 77.28}, {"w": "het", "s": 77.28, "e": 77.44}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 77.44, "e": 77.86}, {"w": "op", "s": 77.86, "e": 78.06}, {"w": "alle", "s": 78.06, "e": 78.32}, {"w": "plekken", "s": 78.32, "e": 79.06}, {"w": "goed", "s": 79.06, "e": 79.4}, {"w": "aansluit.", "s": 79.4, "e": 80.08}]}, {"start": 80.58, "end": 83.3, "text": "Het brandt niet, of het brandt heel slecht.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 80.58, "e": 80.74}, {"w": "brandt", "s": 80.74, "e": 81.2}, {"w": "niet,", "s": 81.2, "e": 81.32}, {"w": "of", "s": 81.48, "e": 81.56}, {"w": "het", "s": 81.56, "e": 81.74}, {"w": "brandt", "s": 81.74, "e": 82.54}, {"w": "heel", "s": 82.54, "e": 82.76}, {"w": "slecht.", "s": 82.76, "e": 83.3}]}, {"start": 83.52, "end": 88.88, "text": "Het is wel doofend, dat houdt in zodra ik stop hier ook mee.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 83.52, "e": 83.66}, {"w": "is", "s": 83.66, "e": 83.74}, {"w": "wel", "s": 83.74, "e": 84.04}, {"w": "doofend,", "s": 84.04, "e": 84.62}, {"w": "dat", "s": 84.72, "e": 84.78}, {"w": "houdt", "s": 84.78, "e": 85.12}, {"w": "in", "s": 85.12, "e": 85.3}, {"w": "zodra", "s": 85.3, "e": 85.62}, {"w": "ik", "s": 85.62, "e": 86.46}, {"w": "stop", "s": 88.06, "e": 88.32}, {"w": "hier", "s": 88.32, "e": 88.44}, {"w": "ook", "s": 88.44, "e": 88.6}, {"w": "mee.", "s": 88.6, "e": 88.88}]}, {"start": 89.38, "end": 93.04, "text": "Of het moet heel heet worden, dan gaat het verder branden.", "words": [{"w": "Of", "s": 89.38, "e": 89.48}, {"w": "het", "s": 89.48, "e": 89.56}, {"w": "moet", "s": 89.56, "e": 89.68}, {"w": "heel", "s": 89.68, "e": 89.98}, {"w": "heet", "s": 89.98, "e": 90.22}, {"w": "worden,", "s": 90.22, "e": 91.14}, {"w": "dan", "s": 92.06, "e": 92.1}, {"w": "gaat", "s": 92.1, "e": 92.22}, {"w": "het", "s": 92.22, "e": 92.32}, {"w": "verder", "s": 92.32, "e": 92.52}, {"w": "branden.", "s": 92.52, "e": 93.04}]}, {"start": 93.36, "end": 98.02, "text": "Het is natuurlijk op oliebasis gemaakt, dus er zit altijd wel wat brandstof in om het zo maar te noemen.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 93.36, "e": 93.5}, {"w": "is", "s": 93.5, "e": 93.6}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 93.6, "e": 93.8}, {"w": "op", "s": 93.8, "e": 93.98}, {"w": "oliebasis", "s": 93.98, "e": 94.64}, {"w": "gemaakt,", "s": 94.64, "e": 94.94}, {"w": "dus", "s": 95.02, "e": 95.16}, {"w": "er", "s": 95.16, "e": 95.3}, {"w": "zit", "s": 95.3, "e": 95.38}, {"w": "altijd", "s": 95.38, "e": 95.68}, {"w": "wel", "s": 95.68, "e": 95.88}, {"w": "wat", "s": 95.88, "e": 96.58}, {"w": "brandstof", "s": 96.58, "e": 97.04}, {"w": "in", "s": 97.04, "e": 97.2}, {"w": "om", "s": 97.2, "e": 97.32}, {"w": "het", "s": 97.32, "e": 97.42}, {"w": "zo", "s": 97.42, "e": 97.5}, {"w": "maar", "s": 97.5, "e": 97.6}, {"w": "te", "s": 97.6, "e": 97.74}, {"w": "noemen.", "s": 97.74, "e": 98.02}]}, {"start": 98.68, "end": 100.72, "text": "En daarom heeft het een brandkastervak van B.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 98.68, "e": 98.84}, {"w": "daarom", "s": 98.84, "e": 99.06}, {"w": "heeft", "s": 99.06, "e": 99.18}, {"w": "het", "s": 99.18, "e": 99.3}, {"w": "een", "s": 99.3, "e": 99.42}, {"w": "brandkastervak", "s": 99.42, "e": 100.14}, {"w": "van", "s": 100.14, "e": 100.4}, {"w": "B.", "s": 100.4, "e": 100.72}]}, {"start": 100.72, "end": 101.52, "text": "Ja, van B.", "words": [{"w": "Ja,", "s": 100.72, "e": 101.06}, {"w": "van", "s": 101.16, "e": 101.28}, {"w": "B.", "s": 101.28, "e": 101.52}]}, {"start": 104.04, "end": 107.9, "text": "Kijk, die begint te gloeien, maar ja, er zit geen brandstof in, dus er gebeurt niks mee.", "words": [{"w": "Kijk,", "s": 104.04, "e": 104.24}, {"w": "die", "s": 104.26, "e": 104.36}, {"w": "begint", "s": 104.36, "e": 104.56}, {"w": "te", "s": 104.56, "e": 104.78}, {"w": "gloeien,", "s": 104.78, "e": 105.0}, {"w": "maar", "s": 105.14, "e": 105.16}, {"w": "ja,", "s": 105.16, "e": 105.3}, {"w": "er", "s": 105.38, "e": 105.38}, {"w": "zit", "s": 105.38, "e": 106.2}, {"w": "geen", "s": 106.2, "e": 106.38}, {"w": "brandstof", "s": 106.38, "e": 106.9}, {"w": "in,", "s": 106.9, "e": 107.04}, {"w": "dus", "s": 107.1, "e": 107.2}, {"w": "er", "s": 107.2, "e": 107.3}, {"w": "gebeurt", "s": 107.3, "e": 107.46}, {"w": "niks", "s": 107.46, "e": 107.64}, {"w": "mee.", "s": 107.64, "e": 107.9}]}, {"start": 115.11, "end": 118.79, "text": "Het heeft namelijk te maken met, in dit isolatie is eigenlijk zo geweven,", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 115.11, "e": 115.17}, {"w": "heeft", "s": 115.17, "e": 115.37}, {"w": "namelijk", "s": 115.37, "e": 115.59}, {"w": "te", "s": 115.59, "e": 115.77}, {"w": "maken", "s": 115.77, "e": 116.01}, {"w": "met,", "s": 116.01, "e": 116.23}, {"w": "in", "s": 116.23, "e": 116.53}, {"w": "dit", "s": 116.53, "e": 116.65}, {"w": "isolatie", "s": 116.65, "e": 117.29}, {"w": "is", "s": 117.29, "e": 117.45}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 117.45, "e": 117.73}, {"w": "zo", "s": 117.73, "e": 118.03}, {"w": "geweven,", "s": 118.03, "e": 118.79}]}, {"start": 119.01, "end": 122.03, "text": "dat er een soort kleine kamertjes ontstaan in de wol.", "words": [{"w": "dat", "s": 119.01, "e": 119.07}, {"w": "er", "s": 119.07, "e": 119.19}, {"w": "een", "s": 119.19, "e": 119.27}, {"w": "soort", "s": 119.27, "e": 119.47}, {"w": "kleine", "s": 119.47, "e": 119.89}, {"w": "kamertjes", "s": 119.89, "e": 120.49}, {"w": "ontstaan", "s": 120.49, "e": 121.07}, {"w": "in", "s": 121.07, "e": 121.61}, {"w": "de", "s": 121.61, "e": 121.91}, {"w": "wol.", "s": 121.91, "e": 122.03}]}, {"start": 122.83, "end": 128.65, "text": "En dat zorgt ervoor dat het eigenlijk de lucht wat er tegenaan komt, dat houdt tegen, of dat houdt het eigenlijk vast.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 122.83, "e": 123.27}, {"w": "dat", "s": 123.27, "e": 123.39}, {"w": "zorgt", "s": 123.39, "e": 123.61}, {"w": "ervoor", "s": 123.61, "e": 123.89}, {"w": "dat", "s": 123.89, "e": 124.11}, {"w": "het", "s": 124.11, "e": 124.25}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 124.25, "e": 124.67}, {"w": "de", "s": 124.67, "e": 124.67}, {"w": "lucht", "s": 124.67, "e": 125.09}, {"w": "wat", "s": 125.09, "e": 125.29}, {"w": "er", "s": 125.29, "e": 125.45}, {"w": "tegenaan", "s": 125.45, "e": 125.83}, {"w": "komt,", "s": 125.83, "e": 126.05}, {"w": "dat", "s": 126.57, "e": 126.73}, {"w": "houdt", "s": 126.73, "e": 127.23}, {"w": "tegen,", "s": 127.23, "e": 127.43}, {"w": "of", "s": 127.51, "e": 127.61}, {"w": "dat", "s": 127.61, "e": 127.71}, {"w": "houdt", "s": 127.71, "e": 127.95}, {"w": "het", "s": 127.95, "e": 128.05}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 128.05, "e": 128.27}, {"w": "vast.", "s": 128.27, "e": 128.65}]}, {"start": 128.81, "end": 131.73, "text": "En dan krijg je stilstaande lucht van in de wol.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 128.81, "e": 128.89}, {"w": "dan", "s": 128.89, "e": 128.97}, {"w": "krijg", "s": 128.97, "e": 129.09}, {"w": "je", "s": 129.09, "e": 129.29}, {"w": "stilstaande", "s": 129.29, "e": 129.97}, {"w": "lucht", "s": 129.97, "e": 130.23}, {"w": "van", "s": 130.23, "e": 130.53}, {"w": "in", "s": 130.53, "e": 131.27}, {"w": "de", "s": 131.27, "e": 131.49}, {"w": "wol.", "s": 131.49, "e": 131.73}]}, {"start": 132.17, "end": 134.83, "text": "En stilstaande lucht, dat isoleert.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 132.17, "e": 132.47}, {"w": "stilstaande", "s": 132.47, "e": 133.15}, {"w": "lucht,", "s": 133.15, "e": 133.65}, {"w": "dat", "s": 134.29, "e": 134.29}, {"w": "isoleert.", "s": 134.29, "e": 134.83}]}, {"start": 135.05, "end": 138.13, "text": "Wat je natuurlijk ziet, hij hangt en ja, hij zit vast.", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 135.05, "e": 135.19}, {"w": "je", "s": 135.19, "e": 135.29}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 135.29, "e": 135.61}, {"w": "ziet,", "s": 135.61, "e": 135.83}, {"w": "hij", "s": 135.91, "e": 136.11}, {"w": "hangt", "s": 136.11, "e": 136.73}, {"w": "en", "s": 136.73, "e": 137.09}, {"w": "ja,", "s": 137.09, "e": 137.41}, {"w": "hij", "s": 137.49, "e": 137.59}, {"w": "zit", "s": 137.59, "e": 137.79}, {"w": "vast.", "s": 137.79, "e": 138.13}]}, {"start": 138.81, "end": 143.21, "text": "Maar eigenlijk, waarvoor ga je isoleren? Voor een hogere isolatiewaarde.", "words": [{"w": "Maar", "s": 138.81, "e": 139.25}, {"w": "eigenlijk,", "s": 139.25, "e": 139.69}, {"w": "waarvoor", "s": 140.27, "e": 140.43}, {"w": "ga", "s": 140.43, "e": 140.61}, {"w": "je", "s": 140.61, "e": 140.73}, {"w": "isoleren?", "s": 140.73, "e": 141.39}, {"w": "Voor", "s": 141.71, "e": 141.85}, {"w": "een", "s": 141.85, "e": 141.93}, {"w": "hogere", "s": 141.93, "e": 142.21}, {"w": "isolatiewaarde.", "s": 142.21, "e": 143.21}]}, {"start": 143.55, "end": 146.73, "text": "En wat je eigenlijk hier doet, hier druk je het hele materiaal.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 143.55, "e": 143.59}, {"w": "wat", "s": 143.59, "e": 143.67}, {"w": "je", "s": 143.67, "e": 143.77}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 143.77, "e": 144.03}, {"w": "hier", "s": 144.03, "e": 144.25}, {"w": "doet,", "s": 144.25, "e": 144.49}, {"w": "hier", "s": 144.91, "e": 145.13}, {"w": "druk", "s": 145.13, "e": 145.39}, {"w": "je", "s": 145.39, "e": 145.49}, {"w": "het", "s": 145.49, "e": 145.71}, {"w": "hele", "s": 145.71, "e": 145.99}, {"w": "materiaal.", "s": 145.99, "e": 146.73}]}, {"start": 146.93, "end": 147.75, "text": "En wat gebeurt er dan?", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 146.93, "e": 147.03}, {"w": "wat", "s": 147.03, "e": 147.13}, {"w": "gebeurt", "s": 147.13, "e": 147.45}, {"w": "er", "s": 147.45, "e": 147.59}, {"w": "dan?", "s": 147.59, "e": 147.75}]}, {"start": 148.15, "end": 152.67, "text": "Daar zit er minder lucht in, minder stilstaande lucht, dus lagere isolatiewaarde.", "words": [{"w": "Daar", "s": 148.15, "e": 148.27}, {"w": "zit", "s": 148.27, "e": 148.43}, {"w": "er", "s": 148.43, "e": 148.75}, {"w": "minder", "s": 148.75, "e": 148.95}, {"w": "lucht", "s": 148.95, "e": 149.27}, {"w": "in,", "s": 149.27, "e": 149.53}, {"w": "minder", "s": 149.79, "e": 150.03}, {"w": "stilstaande", "s": 150.03, "e": 150.51}, {"w": "lucht,", "s": 150.51, "e": 150.91}, {"w": "dus", "s": 151.15, "e": 151.33}, {"w": "lagere", "s": 151.33, "e": 151.89}, {"w": "isolatiewaarde.", "s": 151.89, "e": 152.67}]}, {"start": 152.89, "end": 157.11, "text": "Maar helemaal zo echt plat slaan, niet doen, want dan sta je eigenlijk voor niks in isoleren.", "words": [{"w": "Maar", "s": 152.89, "e": 153.05}, {"w": "helemaal", "s": 153.05, "e": 153.27}, {"w": "zo", "s": 153.27, "e": 153.57}, {"w": "echt", "s": 153.57, "e": 153.95}, {"w": "plat", "s": 153.95, "e": 154.11}, {"w": "slaan,", "s": 154.11, "e": 154.67}, {"w": "niet", "s": 154.85, "e": 154.95}, {"w": "doen,", "s": 154.95, "e": 155.41}, {"w": "want", "s": 155.79, "e": 155.89}, {"w": "dan", "s": 155.89, "e": 156.01}, {"w": "sta", "s": 156.01, "e": 156.11}, {"w": "je", "s": 156.11, "e": 156.13}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 156.13, "e": 156.29}, {"w": "voor", "s": 156.29, "e": 156.39}, {"w": "niks", "s": 156.39, "e": 156.57}, {"w": "in", "s": 156.57, "e": 156.67}, {"w": "isoleren.", "s": 156.67, "e": 157.11}]}, {"start": 157.69, "end": 159.09, "text": "Stop een hoop geld de tijd in.", "words": [{"w": "Stop", "s": 157.69, "e": 157.83}, {"w": "een", "s": 157.83, "e": 157.95}, {"w": "hoop", "s": 157.95, "e": 158.05}, {"w": "geld", "s": 158.05, "e": 158.25}, {"w": "de", "s": 158.25, "e": 158.43}, {"w": "tijd", "s": 158.43, "e": 158.57}, {"w": "in.", "s": 158.57, "e": 159.09}]}, {"start": 169.2, "end": 172.02, "text": "Wat je hier ziet, houd hem 20 centimeter uit de kant.", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 169.2, "e": 169.32}, {"w": "je", "s": 169.32, "e": 169.44}, {"w": "hier", "s": 169.44, "e": 169.66}, {"w": "ziet,", "s": 169.66, "e": 169.96}, {"w": "houd", "s": 170.3, "e": 170.46}, {"w": "hem", "s": 170.46, "e": 170.62}, {"w": "20", "s": 170.62, "e": 170.94}, {"w": "centimeter", "s": 170.94, "e": 171.44}, {"w": "uit", "s": 171.44, "e": 171.66}, {"w": "de", "s": 171.66, "e": 171.8}, {"w": "kant.", "s": 171.8, "e": 172.02}]}, {"start": 173.62, "end": 175.36, "text": "Ongeveer 20 centimeter uit de kant.", "words": [{"w": "Ongeveer", "s": 173.62, "e": 173.94}, {"w": "20", "s": 173.94, "e": 174.32}, {"w": "centimeter", "s": 174.32, "e": 174.78}, {"w": "uit", "s": 174.78, "e": 174.96}, {"w": "de", "s": 174.96, "e": 175.08}, {"w": "kant.", "s": 175.08, "e": 175.36}]}, {"start": 175.36, "end": 177.44, "text": "En dat zie je, dan blijft hij keurig hangen.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 175.36, "e": 175.7}, {"w": "dat", "s": 175.7, "e": 175.9}, {"w": "zie", "s": 175.9, "e": 175.96}, {"w": "je,", "s": 175.96, "e": 176.02}, {"w": "dan", "s": 176.16, "e": 176.18}, {"w": "blijft", "s": 176.18, "e": 176.34}, {"w": "hij", "s": 176.34, "e": 176.4}, {"w": "keurig", "s": 176.4, "e": 176.78}, {"w": "hangen.", "s": 176.78, "e": 177.44}]}, {"start": 177.62, "end": 180.72, "text": "En dat zijn eigenlijk maar vier bevestigingen.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 177.62, "e": 177.62}, {"w": "dat", "s": 177.62, "e": 177.72}, {"w": "zijn", "s": 177.72, "e": 177.84}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 177.84, "e": 178.02}, {"w": "maar", "s": 178.02, "e": 178.22}, {"w": "vier", "s": 178.22, "e": 180.34}, {"w": "bevestigingen.", "s": 180.34, "e": 180.72}]}, {"start": 181.44, "end": 182.26, "text": "Zo gaan we hem vastzetten.", "words": [{"w": "Zo", "s": 181.44, "e": 181.72}, {"w": "gaan", "s": 181.72, "e": 181.9}, {"w": "we", "s": 181.9, "e": 182.08}, {"w": "hem", "s": 182.08, "e": 182.08}, {"w": "vastzetten.", "s": 182.08, "e": 182.26}]}, {"start": 182.64, "end": 183.86, "text": "Dit is de bevestiging.", "words": [{"w": "Dit", "s": 182.64, "e": 182.8}, {"w": "is", "s": 182.8, "e": 182.9}, {"w": "de", "s": 182.9, "e": 183.02}, {"w": "bevestiging.", "s": 183.02, "e": 183.86}]}, {"start": 184.82, "end": 189.6, "text": "En dat is eigenlijk gewoon, ja je ziet hier ook, proef je in.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 184.82, "e": 184.82}, {"w": "dat", "s": 184.82, "e": 185.0}, {"w": "is", "s": 185.0, "e": 185.18}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 185.18, "e": 185.66}, {"w": "gewoon,", "s": 185.66, "e": 186.0}, {"w": "ja", "s": 186.54, "e": 186.72}, {"w": "je", "s": 186.72, "e": 186.8}, {"w": "ziet", "s": 186.8, "e": 186.98}, {"w": "hier", "s": 186.98, "e": 187.2}, {"w": "ook,", "s": 187.2, "e": 188.76}, {"w": "proef", "s": 188.76, "e": 189.16}, {"w": "je", "s": 189.16, "e": 189.28}, {"w": "in.", "s": 189.28, "e": 189.6}]}, {"start": 189.76, "end": 191.5, "text": "Wat doe je? Je boort een mooi gaatje.", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 189.76, "e": 189.9}, {"w": "doe", "s": 189.9, "e": 190.12}, {"w": "je?", "s": 190.12, "e": 190.2}, {"w": "Je", "s": 190.22, "e": 190.32}, {"w": "boort", "s": 190.32, "e": 190.56}, {"w": "een", "s": 190.56, "e": 190.68}, {"w": "mooi", "s": 190.68, "e": 190.92}, {"w": "gaatje.", "s": 190.92, "e": 191.5}]}, {"start": 191.92, "end": 193.4, "text": "Je duwt hem erin en hij zit vast.", "words": [{"w": "Je", "s": 191.92, "e": 192.12}, {"w": "duwt", "s": 192.12, "e": 192.3}, {"w": "hem", "s": 192.3, "e": 192.4}, {"w": "erin", "s": 192.4, "e": 192.66}, {"w": "en", "s": 192.66, "e": 192.82}, {"w": "hij", "s": 192.82, "e": 192.92}, {"w": "zit", "s": 192.92, "e": 193.02}, {"w": "vast.", "s": 193.02, "e": 193.4}]}, {"start": 193.86, "end": 195.24, "text": "En wat doet een sprijtstift?", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 193.86, "e": 194.02}, {"w": "wat", "s": 194.02, "e": 194.28}, {"w": "doet", "s": 194.28, "e": 194.5}, {"w": "een", "s": 194.5, "e": 194.88}, {"w": "sprijtstift?", "s": 194.88, "e": 195.24}]}, {"start": 195.26, "end": 197.56, "text": "Wat doet die sprijtstift? Je ziet al dit.", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 195.26, "e": 195.32}, {"w": "doet", "s": 195.32, "e": 195.44}, {"w": "die", "s": 195.44, "e": 195.56}, {"w": "sprijtstift?", "s": 195.56, "e": 196.22}, {"w": "Je", "s": 196.5, "e": 196.52}, {"w": "ziet", "s": 196.52, "e": 196.74}, {"w": "al", "s": 196.74, "e": 196.9}, {"w": "dit.", "s": 196.9, "e": 197.56}]}, {"start": 197.76, "end": 202.4, "text": "Hier heb je eigenlijk twee wankers tegenover elkaar die je in en uit kunt drukken.", "words": [{"w": "Hier", "s": 197.76, "e": 197.9}, {"w": "heb", "s": 197.9, "e": 198.0}, {"w": "je", "s": 198.0, "e": 198.02}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 198.02, "e": 198.36}, {"w": "twee", "s": 198.36, "e": 199.58}, {"w": "wankers", "s": 199.58, "e": 199.96}, {"w": "tegenover", "s": 199.96, "e": 200.38}, {"w": "elkaar", "s": 200.38, "e": 200.64}, {"w": "die", "s": 200.64, "e": 201.48}, {"w": "je", "s": 201.48, "e": 201.7}, {"w": "in", "s": 201.7, "e": 201.8}, {"w": "en", "s": 201.8, "e": 201.98}, {"w": "uit", "s": 201.98, "e": 201.98}, {"w": "kunt", "s": 201.98, "e": 202.1}, {"w": "drukken.", "s": 202.1, "e": 202.4}]}, {"start": 202.4, "end": 204.72, "text": "Die sprijtstift, die duik je erin.", "words": [{"w": "Die", "s": 202.4, "e": 202.84}, {"w": "sprijtstift,", "s": 202.84, "e": 203.64}, {"w": "die", "s": 203.64, "e": 203.94}, {"w": "duik", "s": 203.94, "e": 204.14}, {"w": "je", "s": 204.14, "e": 204.16}, {"w": "erin.", "s": 204.16, "e": 204.72}]}, {"start": 204.98, "end": 206.76, "text": "En die zorgt eigenlijk dat dit groter wordt.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 204.98, "e": 205.12}, {"w": "die", "s": 205.12, "e": 205.28}, {"w": "zorgt", "s": 205.28, "e": 205.58}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 205.58, "e": 205.86}, {"w": "dat", "s": 205.86, "e": 205.94}, {"w": "dit", "s": 205.94, "e": 206.16}, {"w": "groter", "s": 206.16, "e": 206.48}, {"w": "wordt.", "s": 206.48, "e": 206.76}]}, {"start": 207.34, "end": 210.02, "text": "Dus gewoon beter gaat klemmen in dat gat.", "words": [{"w": "Dus", "s": 207.34, "e": 207.48}, {"w": "gewoon", "s": 207.48, "e": 207.72}, {"w": "beter", "s": 207.72, "e": 208.08}, {"w": "gaat", "s": 208.08, "e": 209.14}, {"w": "klemmen", "s": 209.14, "e": 209.56}, {"w": "in", "s": 209.56, "e": 209.68}, {"w": "dat", "s": 209.68, "e": 209.8}, {"w": "gat.", "s": 209.8, "e": 210.02}]}, {"start": 210.18, "end": 210.98, "text": "Dit is een sprijtstift.", "words": [{"w": "Dit", "s": 210.18, "e": 210.22}, {"w": "is", "s": 210.22, "e": 210.34}, {"w": "een", "s": 210.34, "e": 210.34}, {"w": "sprijtstift.", "s": 210.34, "e": 210.98}]}, {"start": 211.32, "end": 216.86, "text": "Het voordeel van deze bevestiging is, dat is volgens Combyfix, dat je hem ook kunt gebruiken met een spouwanker.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 211.32, "e": 211.42}, {"w": "voordeel", "s": 211.42, "e": 211.7}, {"w": "van", "s": 211.7, "e": 211.92}, {"w": "deze", "s": 211.92, "e": 212.12}, {"w": "bevestiging", "s": 212.12, "e": 212.7}, {"w": "is,", "s": 212.7, "e": 213.02}, {"w": "dat", "s": 213.02, "e": 213.12}, {"w": "is", "s": 213.12, "e": 213.16}, {"w": "volgens", "s": 213.16, "e": 213.36}, {"w": "Combyfix,", "s": 213.36, "e": 214.08}, {"w": "dat", "s": 214.48, "e": 214.58}, {"w": "je", "s": 214.58, "e": 214.68}, {"w": "hem", "s": 214.68, "e": 214.8}, {"w": "ook", "s": 214.8, "e": 214.96}, {"w": "kunt", "s": 214.96, "e": 215.08}, {"w": "gebruiken", "s": 215.08, "e": 215.52}, {"w": "met", "s": 215.52, "e": 215.68}, {"w": "een", "s": 215.68, "e": 215.8}, {"w": "spouwanker.", "s": 215.8, "e": 216.86}]}, {"start": 217.14, "end": 220.32, "text": "En dan heb je eigenlijk weer het stukje sprijtstift erin.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 217.14, "e": 217.3}, {"w": "dan", "s": 217.3, "e": 217.36}, {"w": "heb", "s": 217.36, "e": 217.5}, {"w": "je", "s": 217.5, "e": 217.56}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 217.56, "e": 217.88}, {"w": "weer", "s": 217.88, "e": 218.56}, {"w": "het", "s": 218.56, "e": 218.86}, {"w": "stukje", "s": 218.86, "e": 219.14}, {"w": "sprijtstift", "s": 219.14, "e": 219.66}, {"w": "erin.", "s": 219.66, "e": 220.32}]}, {"start": 221.16, "end": 222.56, "text": "Met een beetje winnen erop.", "words": [{"w": "Met", "s": 221.16, "e": 221.36}, {"w": "een", "s": 221.36, "e": 221.56}, {"w": "beetje", "s": 221.56, "e": 221.94}, {"w": "winnen", "s": 221.94, "e": 222.36}, {"w": "erop.", "s": 222.36, "e": 222.56}]}, {"start": 222.76, "end": 223.76, "text": "Die sla je erin.", "words": [{"w": "Die", "s": 222.76, "e": 222.76}, {"w": "sla", "s": 222.76, "e": 223.0}, {"w": "je", "s": 223.0, "e": 223.04}, {"w": "erin.", "s": 223.04, "e": 223.76}]}, {"start": 224.32, "end": 227.6, "text": "En dan heb je een bevestiging, dan zit je isolatie zit vast door middel van de Combyfix.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 224.32, "e": 224.4}, {"w": "dan", "s": 224.4, "e": 224.56}, {"w": "heb", "s": 224.56, "e": 224.56}, {"w": "je", "s": 224.56, "e": 224.62}, {"w": "een", "s": 224.62, "e": 224.7}, {"w": "bevestiging,", "s": 224.7, "e": 225.32}, {"w": "dan", "s": 225.46, "e": 225.46}, {"w": "zit", "s": 225.46, "e": 225.58}, {"w": "je", "s": 225.58, "e": 225.72}, {"w": "isolatie", "s": 225.72, "e": 226.22}, {"w": "zit", "s": 226.22, "e": 226.42}, {"w": "vast", "s": 226.42, "e": 226.62}, {"w": "door", "s": 226.62, "e": 226.76}, {"w": "middel", "s": 226.76, "e": 226.86}, {"w": "van", "s": 226.86, "e": 226.98}, {"w": "de", "s": 226.98, "e": 227.12}, {"w": "Combyfix.", "s": 227.12, "e": 227.6}]}, {"start": 237.73, "end": 240.89, "text": "Wat natuurlijk wel belangrijk is, is het gaatje in je materiaal.", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 237.73, "e": 237.91}, {"w": "natuurlijk", "s": 237.91, "e": 238.15}, {"w": "wel", "s": 238.15, "e": 238.39}, {"w": "belangrijk", "s": 238.39, "e": 238.71}, {"w": "is,", "s": 238.71, "e": 239.01}, {"w": "is", "s": 239.13, "e": 239.29}, {"w": "het", "s": 239.29, "e": 239.63}, {"w": "gaatje", "s": 239.63, "e": 240.07}, {"w": "in", "s": 240.07, "e": 240.21}, {"w": "je", "s": 240.21, "e": 240.37}, {"w": "materiaal.", "s": 240.37, "e": 240.89}]}, {"start": 241.27, "end": 243.25, "text": "Ik boord er even met een SDS machine.", "words": [{"w": "Ik", "s": 241.27, "e": 241.63}, {"w": "boord", "s": 241.63, "e": 241.91}, {"w": "er", "s": 241.91, "e": 241.97}, {"w": "even", "s": 241.97, "e": 242.13}, {"w": "met", "s": 242.13, "e": 242.33}, {"w": "een", "s": 242.33, "e": 242.57}, {"w": "SDS", "s": 242.57, "e": 242.75}, {"w": "machine.", "s": 242.75, "e": 243.25}]}, {"start": 252.1, "end": 253.24, "text": "En waar is een steenboor voor?", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 252.1, "e": 252.24}, {"w": "waar", "s": 252.24, "e": 252.32}, {"w": "is", "s": 252.32, "e": 252.42}, {"w": "een", "s": 252.42, "e": 252.56}, {"w": "steenboor", "s": 252.56, "e": 252.94}, {"w": "voor?", "s": 252.94, "e": 253.24}]}, {"start": 253.34, "end": 255.16, "text": "Eigenlijk voor de zachtere materialen.", "words": [{"w": "Eigenlijk", "s": 253.34, "e": 253.66}, {"w": "voor", "s": 253.66, "e": 253.86}, {"w": "de", "s": 253.86, "e": 254.0}, {"w": "zachtere", "s": 254.0, "e": 254.36}, {"w": "materialen.", "s": 254.36, "e": 255.16}]}, {"start": 255.82, "end": 258.94, "text": "Kalkzandsteen in Nederland, andere landen kan het weer verschillen.", "words": [{"w": "Kalkzandsteen", "s": 255.82, "e": 256.18}, {"w": "in", "s": 256.18, "e": 256.42}, {"w": "Nederland,", "s": 256.42, "e": 256.96}, {"w": "andere", "s": 257.34, "e": 257.56}, {"w": "landen", "s": 257.56, "e": 257.82}, {"w": "kan", "s": 257.82, "e": 257.98}, {"w": "het", "s": 257.98, "e": 258.12}, {"w": "weer", "s": 258.12, "e": 258.3}, {"w": "verschillen.", "s": 258.3, "e": 258.94}]}, {"start": 259.58, "end": 261.5, "text": "Is het wat harder, maar in Nederland is het zacht materiaal.", "words": [{"w": "Is", "s": 259.58, "e": 259.68}, {"w": "het", "s": 259.68, "e": 259.8}, {"w": "wat", "s": 259.8, "e": 259.88}, {"w": "harder,", "s": 259.88, "e": 260.08}, {"w": "maar", "s": 260.14, "e": 260.3}, {"w": "in", "s": 260.3, "e": 260.4}, {"w": "Nederland", "s": 260.4, "e": 260.62}, {"w": "is", "s": 260.62, "e": 260.8}, {"w": "het", "s": 260.8, "e": 260.92}, {"w": "zacht", "s": 260.92, "e": 261.0}, {"w": "materiaal.", "s": 261.0, "e": 261.5}]}, {"start": 261.5, "end": 263.08, "text": "Gaat prima, gewoon met een steenboortje.", "words": [{"w": "Gaat", "s": 261.5, "e": 261.76}, {"w": "prima,", "s": 261.76, "e": 262.12}, {"w": "gewoon", "s": 262.18, "e": 262.36}, {"w": "met", "s": 262.36, "e": 262.5}, {"w": "een", "s": 262.5, "e": 262.56}, {"w": "steenboortje.", "s": 262.56, "e": 263.08}]}, {"start": 263.3, "end": 264.42, "text": "Wat is nou het verschil?", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 263.3, "e": 263.44}, {"w": "is", "s": 263.44, "e": 263.54}, {"w": "nou", "s": 263.54, "e": 263.64}, {"w": "het", "s": 263.64, "e": 263.74}, {"w": "verschil?", "s": 263.74, "e": 264.42}]}, {"start": 268.14, "end": 270.28, "text": "Het steenboortje, zie je eigenlijk al.", "words": [{"w": "Het", "s": 268.14, "e": 268.24}, {"w": "steenboortje,", "s": 268.24, "e": 269.08}, {"w": "zie", "s": 269.18, "e": 269.24}, {"w": "je", "s": 269.24, "e": 269.36}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 269.36, "e": 269.84}, {"w": "al.", "s": 269.84, "e": 270.28}]}, {"start": 270.84, "end": 272.82, "text": "Dan zit die centimeter erin.", "words": [{"w": "Dan", "s": 270.84, "e": 271.04}, {"w": "zit", "s": 271.04, "e": 271.18}, {"w": "die", "s": 271.18, "e": 271.32}, {"w": "centimeter", "s": 271.32, "e": 271.78}, {"w": "erin.", "s": 271.78, "e": 272.82}]}, {"start": 274.02, "end": 274.86, "text": "Zit er al best wel vast.", "words": [{"w": "Zit", "s": 274.02, "e": 274.1}, {"w": "er", "s": 274.1, "e": 274.22}, {"w": "al", "s": 274.22, "e": 274.28}, {"w": "best", "s": 274.28, "e": 274.42}, {"w": "wel", "s": 274.42, "e": 274.6}, {"w": "vast.", "s": 274.6, "e": 274.86}]}, {"start": 276.06, "end": 281.4, "text": "Bij die SDS heb ik best wel wat ruimte.", "words": [{"w": "Bij", "s": 276.06, "e": 276.2}, {"w": "die", "s": 276.2, "e": 276.4}, {"w": "SDS", "s": 276.4, "e": 277.32}, {"w": "heb", "s": 280.2, "e": 280.52}, {"w": "ik", "s": 280.52, "e": 280.58}, {"w": "best", "s": 280.58, "e": 280.78}, {"w": "wel", "s": 280.78, "e": 280.9}, {"w": "wat", "s": 280.9, "e": 281.02}, {"w": "ruimte.", "s": 281.02, "e": 281.4}]}, {"start": 282.26, "end": 283.78, "text": "Als ik hem doorslag, gaat die ook vastzitten.", "words": [{"w": "Als", "s": 282.26, "e": 282.38}, {"w": "ik", "s": 282.38, "e": 282.48}, {"w": "hem", "s": 282.48, "e": 282.6}, {"w": "doorslag,", "s": 282.6, "e": 283.04}, {"w": "gaat", "s": 283.08, "e": 283.14}, {"w": "die", "s": 283.14, "e": 283.22}, {"w": "ook", "s": 283.22, "e": 283.36}, {"w": "vastzitten.", "s": 283.36, "e": 283.78}]}, {"start": 284.72, "end": 288.48, "text": "Met een steenboortje gaat het lekker snel, vlot, niks in de hand.", "words": [{"w": "Met", "s": 284.72, "e": 285.16}, {"w": "een", "s": 285.16, "e": 285.6}, {"w": "steenboortje", "s": 285.6, "e": 286.5}, {"w": "gaat", "s": 286.5, "e": 286.64}, {"w": "het", "s": 286.64, "e": 286.68}, {"w": "lekker", "s": 286.68, "e": 286.88}, {"w": "snel,", "s": 286.88, "e": 287.18}, {"w": "vlot,", "s": 287.28, "e": 287.52}, {"w": "niks", "s": 287.62, "e": 287.76}, {"w": "in", "s": 287.76, "e": 287.9}, {"w": "de", "s": 287.9, "e": 287.96}, {"w": "hand.", "s": 287.96, "e": 288.48}]}, {"start": 288.92, "end": 289.92, "text": "Dan zit die eigenlijk wel beter vast.", "words": [{"w": "Dan", "s": 288.92, "e": 288.92}, {"w": "zit", "s": 288.92, "e": 289.08}, {"w": "die", "s": 289.08, "e": 289.16}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 289.16, "e": 289.38}, {"w": "wel", "s": 289.38, "e": 289.5}, {"w": "beter", "s": 289.5, "e": 289.66}, {"w": "vast.", "s": 289.66, "e": 289.92}]}, {"start": 290.02, "end": 290.8, "text": "En waarom?", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 290.02, "e": 290.28}, {"w": "waarom?", "s": 290.28, "e": 290.8}]}, {"start": 291.42, "end": 293.9, "text": "Die SDS-boort is gemaakt voor beton.", "words": [{"w": "Die", "s": 291.42, "e": 291.7}, {"w": "SDS", "s": 291.7, "e": 292.08}, {"w": "-boort", "s": 292.08, "e": 292.38}, {"w": "is", "s": 292.38, "e": 292.54}, {"w": "gemaakt", "s": 292.54, "e": 293.0}, {"w": "voor", "s": 293.0, "e": 293.2}, {"w": "beton.", "s": 293.2, "e": 293.9}]}, {"start": 294.26, "end": 297.0, "text": "De bakstenen, bakstenen, die geven grote klappen.", "words": [{"w": "De", "s": 294.26, "e": 294.48}, {"w": "bakstenen,", "s": 294.48, "e": 294.94}, {"w": "bakstenen,", "s": 294.94, "e": 295.9}, {"w": "die", "s": 296.12, "e": 296.12}, {"w": "geven", "s": 296.12, "e": 296.28}, {"w": "grote", "s": 296.28, "e": 296.6}, {"w": "klappen.", "s": 296.6, "e": 297.0}]}, {"start": 297.4, "end": 301.52, "text": "Die gaat eigenlijk veel te snel en met veel te veel geweld door die kalkzandsteen heen.", "words": [{"w": "Die", "s": 297.4, "e": 297.52}, {"w": "gaat", "s": 297.52, "e": 297.7}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 297.7, "e": 298.06}, {"w": "veel", "s": 298.06, "e": 298.22}, {"w": "te", "s": 298.22, "e": 298.42}, {"w": "snel", "s": 298.42, "e": 298.62}, {"w": "en", "s": 298.62, "e": 298.74}, {"w": "met", "s": 298.74, "e": 298.88}, {"w": "veel", "s": 298.88, "e": 299.06}, {"w": "te", "s": 299.06, "e": 299.18}, {"w": "veel", "s": 299.18, "e": 299.28}, {"w": "geweld", "s": 299.28, "e": 299.92}, {"w": "door", "s": 299.92, "e": 300.2}, {"w": "die", "s": 300.2, "e": 300.34}, {"w": "kalkzandsteen", "s": 300.34, "e": 300.96}, {"w": "heen.", "s": 300.96, "e": 301.52}]}, {"start": 302.36, "end": 305.64, "text": "Dus daarom wordt het gaatje wat rommeliger, wat groter.", "words": [{"w": "Dus", "s": 302.36, "e": 302.48}, {"w": "daarom", "s": 302.48, "e": 303.06}, {"w": "wordt", "s": 303.06, "e": 303.12}, {"w": "het", "s": 303.12, "e": 303.32}, {"w": "gaatje", "s": 303.32, "e": 303.74}, {"w": "wat", "s": 303.74, "e": 303.98}, {"w": "rommeliger,", "s": 303.98, "e": 304.56}, {"w": "wat", "s": 304.62, "e": 304.8}, {"w": "groter.", "s": 304.8, "e": 305.64}]}, {"start": 305.76, "end": 306.84, "text": "Wat je eigenlijk niet wil hebben.", "words": [{"w": "Wat", "s": 305.76, "e": 305.86}, {"w": "je", "s": 305.86, "e": 306.02}, {"w": "eigenlijk", "s": 306.02, "e": 306.32}, {"w": "niet", "s": 306.32, "e": 306.5}, {"w": "wil", "s": 306.5, "e": 306.64}, {"w": "hebben.", "s": 306.64, "e": 306.84}]}, {"start": 306.98, "end": 310.88, "text": "Of dat we die Combyfix, die bevestiging erin slaan.", "words": [{"w": "Of", "s": 306.98, "e": 307.24}, {"w": "dat", "s": 307.24, "e": 307.4}, {"w": "we", "s": 307.4, "e": 308.12}, {"w": "die", "s": 308.12, "e": 308.4}, {"w": "Combyfix,", "s": 308.4, "e": 309.02}, {"w": "die", "s": 309.02, "e": 309.34}, {"w": "bevestiging", "s": 309.34, "e": 309.9}, {"w": "erin", "s": 309.9, "e": 310.26}, {"w": "slaan.", "s": 310.26, "e": 310.88}]}, {"start": 310.98, "end": 312.66, "text": "En dat we hem helemaal door kunnen slaan.", "words": [{"w": "En", "s": 310.98, "e": 311.1}, {"w": "dat", "s": 311.1, "e": 311.16}, {"w": "we", "s": 311.16, "e": 311.68}, {"w": "hem", "s": 311.68, "e": 311.7}, {"w": "helemaal", "s": 311.7, "e": 311.92}, {"w": "door", "s": 311.92, "e": 312.2}, {"w": "kunnen", "s": 312.2, "e": 312.38}, {"w": "slaan.", "s": 312.38, "e": 312.66}]}, {"start": 312.66, "end": 313.12, "text": "Maar zo.", "words": [{"w": "Maar", "s": 312.66, "e": 312.66}, {"w": "zo.", "s": 312.66, "e": 313.12}]}, {"start": 314.24, "end": 315.12, "text": "Want als we dat doen?", "words": [{"w": "Want", "s": 314.24, "e": 314.4}, {"w": "als", "s": 314.4, "e": 314.5}, {"w": "we", "s": 314.5, "e": 314.6}, {"w": "dat", "s": 314.6, "e": 314.72}, {"w": "doen?", "s": 314.72, "e": 315.12}]}, {"start": 315.52, "end": 317.14, "text": "Dan ga ik isolatiewaarde missen.", "words": [{"w": "Dan", "s": 315.52, "e": 315.76}, {"w": "ga", "s": 315.76, "e": 315.94}, {"w": "ik", "s": 315.94, "e": 316.08}, {"w": "isolatiewaarde", "s": 316.08, "e": 316.82}, {"w": "missen.", "s": 316.82, "e": 317.14}]}]}